enumeration on one, losing every other GPU with it.

Report conformance version 1.0.0: wgpu hides an adapter reporting major
version 0 unless the application sets ALLOW_UNDERLYING_NONCOMPLIANT_ADAPTER,
which ManimGX's engine does not (nor does it read the WGPU_* variables).

